WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.750
German Democratic Republic 
Wittstock Training Grounds

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.310
Ursula Strachwitz.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:12.150
The daughter of Alfred Strachwitz, 
the man who saved East Germany?

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:14.760
Comrade Captain...

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.080
We have been entrusted with the future

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:22.070
by Alfred and Captain Bernhard.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:29.250
We will begin our advance on 
East Berlin in the morning.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:36.090
To eliminate the Stasi and create 
a new East Germany ourselves.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.020
We will begin Operation 
Saint Ursula immediately.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:47.060
Entrust me with your lives, 
for the sake of the future we desire!

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:24.390
German Democratic Republic 
Bebersee Base

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.620
Things in Berlin are stabilizing.

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.350
Major Brehme,

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:32.530
you and the Werewolf Battalion will go to 
the Oder-Neisse absolute defense line

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.380
and eliminate the BETAs.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.780
We cannot have Fort Seelow fall, you see.

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:40.370
Understood.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.050
If we're heading for the front lines,

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:47.980
does that mean the war is going badly?

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:50.510
Is that something for you to worry about?

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:52.280
I-I'm sorry.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.880
The Werewolf Battalion is rolling out.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:03.000
Your squad will defend the base.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:03.940
Roger.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.790
They're finally gone.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:17.100
Now we can relax a little.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.600
They were watching us the whole time.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.880
What the hell are you doing?

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.810
Don't treat national resources so 
carelessly, you non-citizens.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.020
Do you want to get purged?

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:31.230
Very sorry.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.600
We'll be careful in the future.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.760
That fool...

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:39.380
He thinks he's one of the Stasi.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.820
This is bad, old man.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.950
Someone's going to kill him.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.330
You must have a lot of free time if you're talking.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.320
Miss...

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:54.940
You're not under arrest because we 
need you to maintain the TSFs.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.340
Don't forget that you'll 
eventually be interrogated.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:03:59.380
Interrogated?

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:02.850
We've already learned that you were, 
along with Irisdina Bernhard,

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:05.720
connected to anti-government forces.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:10.080
You should ensure your men 
keep it under control,

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.770
if you don't want to be deemed unnecessary.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.610
So they won't kill us, 
as long as they need us?

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.190
Then there's still hope...

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.520
In this situation?

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.820
The kids made it away safely.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.540
That's why she's starting to panic.

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:34.070
Be ready.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.630
Roger.

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:42.050
German Democratic Republic 
Wittstock Training Grounds

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:47.250
Our surface forces will head along 
the roads to East Berlin

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.680
to draw the enemy's attention.

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:52.520
While they're distracted, 
you'll attack Bebersee Base

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.940
and retake your captured fellows.

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:59.230
If we add the name of the present hero, 
Captain Irisdina Bernhard,

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:02.890
to Alfred Strachwitz, the hero of the past...

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.250
More people will be willing to help us.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.450
Understood.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:08.950
Sir...

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.750
General?

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:24.040
Something drastic has happened.

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:28.380
Survivors of the Stasi Berlin faction 
have made contact with us.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:36.090
Their leader is Stasi Chief of 
Operations Heinze Axmann.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:41.860
German Democratic Republic 
Feldberg Forest

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.720
We're sure this is the right place?

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.830
<i>Heinze Axmann...</i>

00:05:55.170 --> 00:06:00.500
<i>The leader of the asylum-seeker hunters, 
who ruined all our plans.</i>

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.460
<i>The Brown Beast.</i>

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:07.370
<i>I can never forgive him...</i>

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.190
So you're Major General Heim's ambassadors?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.350
This way.

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:34.810
What is this?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:39.240
We built this place on our own 
so we could continue the war,

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:42.210
even after the front lines collapsed.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.500
Axmann...

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:49.440
You plan to attack Bebersee Base, right?

00:06:51.170 --> 00:06:56.520
Use our forces to take back Irisdina Bernhard...

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:00.130
And make her into the hero who saves the nation,

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.910
then eliminate the Moscow faction 
from the country.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.930
What do you want in exchange?

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:12.240
We want guarantees of a place 
in the new government.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.240
You think you're in any position to negotiate?

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:21.470
I'm sure you've heard of the Stasi files, yes?

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:23.040
The Stasi files?

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.790
I knew that was it.

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:37.870
The Stasi files, a massive database containing 
private data on everyone:

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:42.020
individual citizens, military, police, 
and even party members.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:47.820
The rumors say they even contain information 
on the scandals of Western politicians.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.610
That's right.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:53.820
A secret Akashic record that holds 
all of the world's corruption...

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:58.290
It will be very helpful in saving 
the nation from any threats.

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:00.290
Such scum...

00:08:04.070 --> 00:08:06.060
<i>This plan is risky.</i>

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:07.790
<i>But...</i>

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.340
We just got word from an 
informant in Bebersee Base.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.870
The BETAs have resumed their attack.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:21.300
The Werewolf Battalion has gone to meet 
them, and all that's left at the base

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:25.430
is a small number of pilots, 
including Lise Hohenstein.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.660
You think we can win with these alone?

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.110
It's quite possible, I think.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:39.140
As long as we save Irisdina, whom you can 
use, you don't care if the others die?

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:46.040
That's unfair, so we'll risk your life, too.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:49.300
We'll use Heinze Axmann as a decoy.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.800
You're the perfect bait for the Moscow faction.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.550
If you can't do it, then no deal.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:59.810
We'll all be purged by the Stasi together.

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.150
You bastard...

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:07.810
German Democratic Republic 
Bebersee Base

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.440
Sylwia...

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:14.270
I'm sorry.

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:15.820
Inghild...

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:19.820
I... I couldn't protect anyone.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.650
Come out.

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.310
Where's Sylwia?

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:31.830
Is Pham still alive?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:32.710
Is she safe?

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.980
For now.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:40.220
But what will they do if the same thing 
happens to their cute little friend?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.230
Do you... Do you know what you're doing?!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:49.730
Theodor fought for so long 
to save you from the Stasi!

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:47.000
Yes?

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:52.170
Along with Captain Bernhard!

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:57.420
Be quiet for a moment.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.670
Prepare a squad to launch.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.790
I'll take the lead.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.400
Put her back in the cell.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.670
Prepare to launch. Hurry.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.530
What happened?

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:23.430
German Democratic Republic 
Bebersee Base

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:26.430
So you were caught by the part of the NPA 
influenced by the Moscow faction.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:30.690
Bad luck, Comrade Lieutenant Colonel.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:37.130
You're under suspicion of treason.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:40.160
Look forward to your interrogation.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:44.700
No, your arrival was part of my plan.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.700
You think you can beg for your life now?

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:50.030
It's possible.

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.660
Because I'm able to speak to you.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:58.330
Do you not want to know where your brother is?

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:02.470
We have him in custody.

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.800
He is a hostage who works only on you.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.670
You don't expect me to believe—

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.000
He was with Katia Waldheim.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:18.460
Now, put that thing away, 
would you? It's dangerous.

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:32.170
So you're telling me to guarantee your safety 
in exchange for my brother, right?

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.380
Correct.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.010
Jamming?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.140
Go, Theodor!

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.770
Three reds. Success!

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:55.490
We'll assault the base in time with your attack.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:58.460
We're counting on you, pilots of the 666th!

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.400
Roger!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.330
Here we go!

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.240
Hangar secured.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:33.020
No enemies in sight.

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.690
Deploy all units.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.520
We will now begin the operation.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.960
Irisdina!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.180
That's right. Take the bait.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:15.060
You don't know if it's Theodor piloting this TSF,

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.310
so you can't leave!

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:20.090
Those movements... 
You're Lieutenant Jeckeln, right?

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.100
So that's it.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.780
You can't fool me, bitch!

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:46.350
Stop playing and get ready to run!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:47.050
Right!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.730
Maintenance Chief!

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:49.790
Kid?

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:52.010
The squad's in the cells below.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:52.680
Hurry.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:53.610
Got it.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.380
Team C's secured the comms tower.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:59.350
Okay, hurry and get the rest of the 666th!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:02.320
What do we do with them?

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.030
Leave them.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:05.950
But...

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.640
If we kill them, we'll be just like the Stasi!

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:09.780
Do you get that?!

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.860
Anett! Are you safe?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.460
Theodor...

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:28.870
Hey, you okay?

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.310
There are more here! Help!

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.330
No sign of our primary objective!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:50.820
Pham...

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.850
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:58.330
I'm sorry!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.680
It's my fault!

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:05.840
You weren't wrong about anything.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:10.220
I'm sure Lise didn't really want to do that.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:15.850
We have to save her from her twisted feelings.

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:20.640
Precisely because this world is so hopeless...

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:25.110
You can't forget to believe in people, right?

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:31.640
You can't lose sight of the last light.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:34.540
That's what Irisdina taught me.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.220
I won't let anyone suffer anymore.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:48.530
I always thought of you as a cute little brother.

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.760
You've grown up so much...

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:53.750
To me, you were always

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:57.310
my big sis.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:01.970
You finally called me that, huh?

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:04.680
Theodor,

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:06.770
take care of the captain.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:08.920
I will.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.530
Attention, all units.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.530
Unknown approaching from the north.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:19.740
One unit, arriving in ninety seconds.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:23.000
Multiple unknown contacts 
approaching from the south.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:25.070
These will arrive in ten minutes.

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:27.290
The Werewolf Battalion?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.580
Get that chopper launched.

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:32.340
People first! Don't leave a single one behind!

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:40.160
Irisdina!

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:46.660
Where are you?

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.190
Where?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.020
Irisdina!

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:51.820
Iris!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.800
Eberbach, we're out of time.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.180
Back to your unit!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.340
But Irisdina is still—

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:59.820
No. Sorry, but there's no more time.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:04.340
Damn it!

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:13.270
Brother.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.220
Lise...

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:17.680
Run, Theodor!

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.710
That woman is gone.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:26.480
You have no hope left.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.210
Lise,

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.570
where is Irisdina?

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.860
You understand, don't you?

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:37.280
If you want to change this country, we need her!

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:43.330
If you don't surrender now, I'll kill this woman.

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:46.960
And I'll chase down all your 
other friends and kill them.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.880
I'll destroy the base and everything else.

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:51.590
Lise...

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.810
Please, Brother.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:55.230
Give up!

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:57.730
This country doesn't matter!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.070
Please.

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:02.400
Come and be with me...

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.500
I've worked so hard up to now.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.520
For you.

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:12.230
I've killed so many asylum-seekers.

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:14.730
I've informed on so many friends.

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.360
I've used my body to seduce higher-ups!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.870
I've been taken by Axmann and become his dog!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.020
So...

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.040
Please.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:36.530
No...

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.090
I'll ask once more.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.890
Where is Iris?

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.060
That's just like you, Brother.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:53.130
You're so stubborn...

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.680
And so stupid!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.820
Why?

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:02.820
I don't understand!

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:04.700
Why her?

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:11.530
By now, she has some other man inside her, 
and she's forgotten all about you!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:15.300
She was capable of killing her own family!

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:17.440
But I'm different!

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:21.830
I've lived solely for your sake!

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.140
And yet...

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:30.180
And yet I'm not good enough?

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:34.970
All I want is you!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:45.370
No, Lise. You're not that type of girl, are you?

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.200
So stop this.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:49.830
You're—

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:53.500
Don't get in my way!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.350
Big Sis...

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.480
Why?

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:19.730
Why did you kill her?!

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:23.470
She was trying to save you!

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:24.500
And you...

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:26.350
And you...

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.750
Gotcha, Brother.

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:41.420
Do you remember that villa outside Berlin 
we visited with Mom and Dad?

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:47.760
There were swans flying, 
and the lake was so pretty.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:51.450
It was so much fun!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:53.890
Lise...

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.140
What are you doing?

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.490
Hurry up and kill her!

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.650
The Werewolves are coming back!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.900
Kill her! Hurry!

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.650
Let's go home, Brother!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:11.960
Damn it...

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:13.240
The Werewolves!

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:31.810
Brother...

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:16.730
No... Big Sis...

00:23:29.730 --> 00:23:32.630
What happened?

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:37.750
Lise,

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:41.010
you're no longer...

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:55.750
<b>To Be Continued</b>
